  "notes": "Both images are the same composite; headers read from the bottom-left board view with external labels. Notes for VBAT/VBUS/VSYS, A-LDO2/B-LDO2, DC4 and DC1 come from the printed legend text in the image. Several left-header pads (GND after VSYS through DC5) are hidden under the display flex in the photo but are labeled. TF card, LoRa, IMU, RTC, PMU, BME280 and QMC6310 IO lists are internal assignments, not header pins, and are skipped. Images differ only in PMU SDA/SCL text."
